<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\惑星宝石箱.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Yesterday was the opening ceremony and today was the entrance ceremony, and both days school let out in the morning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For curing my spring-break daze, a schedule this relaxed was a help.<PG>
But now we had important business ahead, important enough to blow that spring-break daze away.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"See ya, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. Don't be late!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考える.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Understood! The genius girl Erina Goto shall race toward the success of the operation!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> gave a crisp salute.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"What time's the train again?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"12:40. We can't take it too easy. If we're late, we won't make it to Arata today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tomorrow was the thirteenth-year memorial service for <STYLE ID="4">Haruka's dad</STYLE>. [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This time, as a special exception, we outsiders had been allowed to attend.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At last I would be able to put my hands together in prayer for <STYLE ID="4">Haruka's dad</STYLE>, who died trying to save me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I'm not supposed to be glad about it, but I still am.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, here at 12:00, then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Since birth, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> and I have been childhood friends, and for the past 10 years we've been next-door neighbors.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For just the 2 years before that, a lot happened and we were apart, but <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> came back to Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But why <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> came back is hazy to me.<PG>
If I remember right, <STYLE ID="5">Haruka's dad</STYLE> died, and they went to Megasawa so <STYLE ID="6">Obasan</STYLE> could recover, and came back once she was well again... was that it?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm home! </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, lunch, quick!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Oh, you're back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? What about work?</STYLE> <STYLE ID="3">Skipping?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hey, what do you mean, skipping... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Yesterday </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> told me not to go to the office, remember? Said to go in the afternoon..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh! Right, right!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's right, yesterday I heard <STYLE ID="4">Haruka's dad</STYLE>'s voice, so I told <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> to stay home for the morning.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> left lunch for you over there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\台所1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\重箱.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In the kitchen, three huge tiered lunch boxes were stacked up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... I can't eat this much...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, it's so you'd be covered even if you got back late. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">As a boxed lunch you can take it with you, and the three of you can eat it, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Those lunch boxes are cheap ones, so you can toss them when you're done."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see, that makes it easy!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　So, where's </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"She should be back soon. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">She went to buy a gift to bring to the memorial service."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Right, we can't show up empty-handed when they're putting us up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Then the door opened, and I felt the air in the house stir.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> had just come home.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Welcome back, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, take this as a gift, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カップ置く音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\手土産.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I was handed yet another enormous thing, a box of sake.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "96" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's a bit much to carry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Want me to drive you to the station?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, no! Stay home today!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　We're taking a taxi, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'ll help me carry stuff. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Oh! I need to tell those two not to eat lunch!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,アイテム1,アイテム2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
I headed into my room, pulling out my phone.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\自室背景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
While composing a message to the two of them, I did a final check of my luggage.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Um, messages, check. Change of clothes, check. Everything else, check!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Looked like I hadn't forgotten anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumiii</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! The taxi's here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okaaay! Coming right now!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I carried my luggage out of my room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家廊下.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'm off!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Be careful!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I left the house with barely a goodbye.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The wind that suddenly blew up felt so good against my whole body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh, that's right!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! It's about time you cut back on drinking! </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> says so!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Ah, r-right... Damn </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">that guy</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> had been drinking a little too much lately.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Actually, the warning wasn't from <STYLE ID="4">Ojisan</STYLE>, but from me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, it's a white lie in a good cause. It's for my family's health, so it's forgivable, right?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Harukaaa</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! The taxi's here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
The moment I said it, the Niimuras' door opened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Perfect timing! I figured it was about time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Whoa, that's a lot of luggage..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"They made me take all sorts of stuff..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, I'm in charge of this one!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> took the sake for the gift.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> put her hand on the Kogoris' doorknob.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, hey there!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> and Mom were still standing in the entryway.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Yeah, be careful. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Come to think of it, what are you doing once you get to the station over there? It's pretty far, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s coming to pick us up in the car. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">She went on ahead 'cause she's busy with the preparations, but she says she should be free by the time we get there. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">See ya!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Obasan</STYLE> was going to meet us at the station closest to the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Obasan</STYLE> had gone ahead to the Arata settlement the day before yesterday to prepare for the thirteenth-year memorial service.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター前.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター中.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション入り口.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション前.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\車内後部座席.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"To Motoki Station, please!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Normally we got around by bike or car, so we hardly ever took taxis.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So just from getting into a taxi, our excitement was already building.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I knew it was inappropriate, but it felt a little like going on a trip.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, how about the three of us take a trip somewhere over the next holidays?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm, a trip, huh... Come to think of it, just the three of us have never left Motoki-cho together. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Ah, but... I'm taking entrance exams this year. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> might not let me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ahh, tough break... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Then how about going before exam season really kicks in?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Then I guess Golden Week. But won't everywhere be crowded... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Actually, won't it all be booked up already?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Right, it's less than a month away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Then... maybe find some hideaway inn?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I bet everybody's got the same idea.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　One way or another, I get the feeling we'll end up at some guesthouse in Motoki-cho..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ha! But wouldn't that be fun in its own way?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　In May, Motoki-cho doesn't get many tourists, and as long as the three of us can go somewhere, anywhere's fine with me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, yeah! No objections here either!"</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
